	description = #autoLOC_6011135	//#autoLOC_6011135 = Comets are balls of volatile materials - various ices - and dusty rock.\n\nA low percentage of comets get pulled into the inner system and have an apoapsis near Jool, due to the great green giantâ€™s massive gravity well, but they seem more populous because of how often they approach the Sun  This is one of them.  Its period is such that it can be seen passing by often if tracked.
